    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'an exciting arcade game where the player must control the ball through
    various levels, overcoming obstacles and collecting balls to accumulate points.
    The goal of the game is to run the maximum possible distance using agility and
    reaction.


    During each run, the player must skillfully jump over obstacles,
    avoiding collisions, and collect balls, which can later be used at the end of
    the run. Upon completion of the level, the player can throw the collected balls
    down, which will bring him additional bonus points depending on the number of
    balls collected.'
